":"https://api.github.com/users/kform-danish-office","user_view_type":"public"},"body":"Revised full thesis covering the development from the V1/G071 prototype through the integrated V2/F410 board and the slimmer V3 edge-card design.\n\nDownloads:\n- **Thesis_V1_V2_V3.pdf** — complete 432-page thesis, including the V2 schematics and all 31 PCB print pages.\n- **Thesis_V1_V2_V3_Source.zip** — current editable XeLaTeX project, figures, measurement records and supporting source (485 files).\n- **SHA256SUMS.txt** — checksums for both downloads.\n\nThe V3 discussion includes the estimated 8% net volume reduction after removing the USB-PD section, the secondary-winding observations and suspected input-current-path bottleneck. Replacement magnetics and V3 continuous-power validation remain unfinished. The 240 W EPR level is a future development goal.\n\nThe source ZIP attached above contains the current thesis work. GitHub's automatic “Source code” archives represent the older repository checkout associated with the tag.\n\nValidation: full XeLaTeX/latexmk build; no undefined references or citations, missing characters, overfull boxes or physical-page text overflow. All four current V2 schematic sheets and 31 PCB pages verified in the PDF. Source ZIP CRCs and every member hash verified.\n","created_at":"2026-10-27T04:24:56Z","draft":true,"html_url":"https://github.com/kform-danish-office/Thesis/releases/tag/untagged-5e625ca2f0e1023eb01e","id":425033239,"immutable":false,"name":"Thesis - V1, V2 and V3 development","node_id":"RE_kwDOS_rRQc4ZVX4X","prerelease":true,"published_at":null,"tag_name":"thesis-v1-v2-v3-review","tarball_url":null,"target_commitish":"e3c3f6ac36ab1458dcf8e20dbb71da87fd1cf51a","updated_at":"2026-10-27T04:25:27Z","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/kform-danish-office/Thesis/releases/425033239/assets{?name,label}","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kform-danish-office/Thesis/releases/425033239","zipball_url":null}
